    ["<DecH>工艺：</>玄黑绒呢・银饰扣环・鲁恩学者礼服\n知识在褶皱间沉淀，岁月在衣摆上流连。\n这是属于旧时代的优雅，亦是属于守护者的沉默。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Jet-black Velvet · Silver Buckle · Loen Scholar's Formal Wear \n Knowledge settles in the folds, and time lingers on the hem. \n This is the elegance belonging to the old era, and it is also the silence belonging to the Guardian.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>黄铜镶嵌・暗红血石\n信仰需要指向对的方向，时刻审视自我之心，切勿跌入无尽的迷途。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Brass Inlay · Dark Red Bloodstone \n Faith needs to point in the right direction; always scrutinize your own heart, and do not fall into an endless lost path.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>深棕皮甲・菌络背饰・生物学者装\n大海之上疯狂的存在，皮手套下诞生千奇百怪的生命，每一株植物都是他的\"孩子\"，在实验中落地生根。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Dark Brown Leather Armor · Fungal Back Ornament · Biologist Outfit \n A mad existence on the sea; strange lives are born under leather gloves. Every plant is his \"child,\" taking root in experiments.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>蓝白蕾丝\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白菱格的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Blue-White Lace\nEven if you are an accidental guest, please follow the etiquette of dress. Put on the playful blue-and-white diamond-patterned gown and join the whimsical tea party.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</> 我说了很多次了，我不是什么毒素专家。我只是比较擅长让植物和动物产生一些特殊的化合物。"] = "<P_Heart> (Sighs) </> I've said it many times, I'm not a Toxin Expert. I'm just quite good at getting plants and animals to produce certain special compounds.",
